OL,3,AThousands without power as Isaias
OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias is likely to bring a
OL,8,F"life-threatening storm surge" to the
OL,9,FUS Gulf Coast, the National Hurricane
OL,10,FCenter warns
OL,12,FExactly when and where the category 3
OL,13,Fstorm will make landfall is not clear
OL,15,FThousands are without power in the
OL,16,Fcountry's southeast - and Alabama,
OL,17,FFlorida and Georgia have issued states
OL,18,Fof emergency as they brace for heavy
OL,19,Frains and flooding
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
