OL,3,AThousands without power as Isaias
OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Get out NOW!" warn some Florida
OL,8,Fofficials, urging residents to follow
OL,9,Fevacuation orders as the state feels
OL,10,Fthe storm's initial impacts
OL,12,FOne Florida resident tells the BBC that
OL,13,F"everyone's gone", but he's remaining
OL,14,Fin his home, securing his ducks and
OL,15,Fchickens in the bathroom
OL,17,FAn Alabama beach town has instated a
OL,18,Fcurfew - warning residents to stay
OL,19,Findoors until tomorrow
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
